The files in grids/ (*.gridset) are built from Smartbox Assistive Technology's stock Grid 3 grid sets
(WhatsApp and YouTube). They contain Smartbox's layouts, cells, styles and images, changed by this project's
builder. That material belongs to Smartbox and is not covered by this repository's MIT licence. It is shared
for personal, non-commercial use by Grid 3 users. If you represent Smartbox and want it removed, open an issue.

The builder (tools/build-site.ps1) reads the stock grid sets from your own Grid 3 installation. This
repository does not include them.
